Computer operation package

Permission settings reuse the reviewed Sailry UI from ab5251de:
plugins/builtin/computer/desktop.rs
plugins/builtin/computer/desktop/view.rs
plugins/builtin/computer/desktop/messages.rs
locales/en.yml and locales/zh-CN.yml

Execution uses agent-desktop from vercel-labs/agent-desktop v1.2.0 at
2b0a7334fc111730454b726e6800aa41cdafc093 (Apache-2.0). Sailry packages the
unmodified official release executables; the application packaging notices
retain its license and provenance. The package instructions adapt the
agent-desktop skill guidance bundled with that release.

This package declares the MCP service, its tool selection, instructions, tool
display metadata and permission settings. Native helper selection, protected
execution resources, ordinary approvals, cancellation and media projection stay
in the Node.
